# River stones: water-worn, rounded cobbles and small boulders in a river's bed and on its banks - many where the water
# runs FAST (rapids, a steep stream), few in slow water. The colour is the climate's bedrock (Color tints it). Format:
# Code/Procedural/CONTEXT.md, "Ground clutter".
ClutterType RiverStone
	Kind Pebble
	Seed 227
	Variants 6
	Scale 0.12 0.65
	Range 110
	Sink 0.35
	Align 0.8
	Color 0.95 0.95 0.95
	Lod 240
	Aspect 1 0.6 0.8
	AspectVar 0.2 0.2 0.2
	Erosion 0.28
	Noise 0.02 2.0 3
	Placement
		Density 0.15
		# in the channel and on its banks, scaled up hard by the speed of the water
		River 0 1
		Flow 0.05 0.5
		Cluster 9 0.6
		Slope 1.2
		Altitude -1000
